WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 066. THE WORK IS EVERYWHERE. Synthetic matters, authorities, arguments, documents, expert roles, outcomes, workflows, and lessons begin as disconnected fragments.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
CONNECT THE OBJECTS. ASSEMBLE THE MEMORY. Link each fixed object by declared relationship, source, verification, access, review state, and matter context.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
KEEP GOVERNANCE VISIBLE. SOURCE · STATUS · ACCESS · OWNER. Finding a record does not establish current law, citation validity, privilege, confidentiality, relevance, or permission to reuse.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
PRESERVE REVIEW STATES. UNVERIFIED · RESTRICTED · CONTESTED · UNREVIEWED. Do not flatten distinct authority, access, outcome, and lesson-review failures into one generic warning.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUND THE RESULT. INSTITUTIONAL MEMORY, NOT A LEGAL CONCLUSION. This fixed synthetic graph provides no legal advice and contains no real client, matter, person, citation, or protected information.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. THE FIRM KNOWS MORE THAN ITS FOLDERS. LEGAL MEMORY BECOMES USABLE WHEN OBJECTS, RELATIONSHIPS, SOURCES, STATES, ACCESS, AND LIMITS STAY CONNECTED.

